    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly presents 3 The Beeches, a bright and spacious two-bedroom corner apartment enjoying a superb first-floor position within the mature and highly regarded Dunstaffnage Hall development, just minutes from Stillorgan Village. Set amid beautifully landscaped grounds, the property benefits from excellent natural light, a distinctive contemporary layout and a designated parking space.\r\n\r\nThe generous open-plan living, dining and kitchen area is a particular highlight, featuring attractive curved walls and a striking glazed window bay which floods the interior with natural light and creates an appealing focal point within the room. The corner position further enhances the sense of light and space.\r\n\r\nThe well-proportioned accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, spacious open-plan living/dining area with fitted kitchen, two generous bedrooms with built-in wardrobes and a bathroom. Comfortable and easily managed, the apartment will appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nDunstaffnage Hall is an attractive, low-density development distinguished by its wonderful mature setting. Extensive lawns, mature trees and established planting give the grounds an almost parkland feel, creating a peaceful and private environment despite the exceptional convenience of the location. The development is approached through secure electric gates and was completed in 1999 on the former grounds of Dunstaffnage House.\r\n\r\nMore about the location...\r\n\r\nThe location is superb, with Stillorgan Village and Stillorgan Shopping Centre within easy walking distance, offering an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities. Dundrum, Blackrock and UCD are also easily accessible. The area is particularly well connected, with frequent bus services providing convenient access to Dublin city centre and the surrounding south Dublin suburbs.\r\n\r\nA bright and spacious corner apartment with parking, distinctive architectural character and beautiful mature surroundings, all within easy reach of the heart of Stillorgan."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway (4.43m x 1.71m)\r\nA well-proportioned entrance hallway with a useful storage unit, wall-mounted intercom and hot press, providing access to the accommodation.\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining/Kitchen (8.28m x 5.80m max.)\r\nA bright and spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen area featuring a distinctive curved feature wall and an enclosed square-shaped glass bay, creating an unusual and attractive focal point within the room. The space also benefits from hidden storage and a co-dining counter, while the kitchen is fitted with a tiled backsplash, Zanussi oven and grill, Bosch washing machine, Bosch dishwasher and Bosch four-ring electric hob.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (4.90m x 2.59m)\r\nA generous double bedroom featuring built-in wardrobes, providing excellent storage.\r\n\r\nBathroom (1.98m x 1.71m)\r\nThe bathroom is fitted with a WC, wash hand basin and shower enclosure, with tiled flooring and partly tiled walls.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (4.88m x 2.61m)\r\nA second double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and ample storage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Bright and spacious two-bedroom apartment.\r\nFirst-floor setting into a quiet courtyard.\r\nSituated within a mature, low-density gated development.\r\nSecure electric gates providing privacy and security.\r\nBeautifully maintained landscaped communal gardens.\r\nWest-facing windows to living room and bedroom.\r\nExcellent afternoon and evening natural light.\r\nDesignated parking space.\r\nWell managed development.\r\nHighly convenient location close to Stillorgan Village and excellent transport links."
      },
      {
